WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.830
=Episode 32=

01:35.090 --> 01:37.370
Take your positions.

01:59.250 --> 02:01.570
Offer incense.

02:22.370 --> 02:25.290
Present jade and silk.

02:30.329 --> 02:31.850
Kneel.

02:39.450 --> 02:41.650
Bow.

02:42.850 --> 02:44.490
Rise.

02:46.810 --> 02:49.210
Bow again.

02:51.970 --> 02:53.210
Rise.

02:55.370 --> 02:57.730
Bow thrice.

02:59.650 --> 03:01.130
Rise.

03:02.730 --> 03:04.170
Get up.

03:06.810 --> 03:08.690
The winter sacrificial ceremony
is concluded.

03:08.890 --> 03:10.610
Officials,

03:10.650 --> 03:13.650
please proceed to Longtai Hall.

03:23.370 --> 03:23.890
Yan He.

03:24.490 --> 03:25.370
When did you arrive?

03:26.170 --> 03:27.970
I always thought
you were short and thin,

03:28.170 --> 03:29.610
but never expected you were a woman.

03:31.010 --> 03:31.770
Well...

03:32.170 --> 03:33.610
Do you look down on me

03:33.650 --> 03:35.570
and disdain being friends with me

03:35.730 --> 03:37.410
because I'm a woman now?

03:38.050 --> 03:39.130
Do you think

03:39.170 --> 03:40.490
I am that kind of base person?

03:41.050 --> 03:41.810
I'm angry because

03:41.890 --> 03:43.250
you and Xiao Jue hid this from me.

03:44.130 --> 03:45.930
We had to.

03:46.050 --> 03:47.170
I didn't want to either.

03:48.050 --> 03:48.530
By the way,

03:49.210 --> 03:50.810
how is your wife recently?

03:51.410 --> 03:52.210
She's quite well.

03:52.810 --> 03:53.650
The baby

03:53.770 --> 03:54.850
has behaved.

03:59.210 --> 04:00.970
But the Huayuan battle
turned out like this,

04:01.650 --> 04:03.210
how dare He Rufei show his face here?

04:12.050 --> 04:12.850
Excellent.

04:13.090 --> 04:14.210
Everyone is here.

04:15.170 --> 04:15.730
Let's go.

04:23.690 --> 04:25.970
Greetings, Your Majesty.

04:28.050 --> 04:29.250
Rise, everyone.

04:47.409 --> 04:48.690
I am Maningbu,

04:48.890 --> 04:50.890
greetings to Emperor Wei.

04:51.210 --> 04:53.090
You have traveled far,

04:53.170 --> 04:53.970
must be weary.

04:54.810 --> 04:56.810
As a foreign envoy,

04:57.010 --> 04:58.450
I've heard of

04:58.610 --> 04:59.650
your ear for talent

04:59.850 --> 05:00.850
and prudent governance.

05:01.050 --> 05:02.530
What a model ruler of our age.

05:03.130 --> 05:04.970
I deeply respect you.

05:05.730 --> 05:06.610
Today,

05:06.770 --> 05:07.890
I want to offer you a toast.

05:12.890 --> 05:14.130
Your words

05:14.370 --> 05:15.970
are really flattering me.

05:24.890 --> 05:26.730
Your generous hospitality

05:26.930 --> 05:29.290
really moves me.

05:29.610 --> 05:31.850
Wei and Wutuo are neighbors,

05:32.250 --> 05:34.570
so we should share brotherly bonds

05:34.930 --> 05:36.170
as we do now in harmony.

05:36.490 --> 05:37.370
With this opportunity,

05:37.730 --> 05:39.450
Wutuo wishes to ally with Wei,

05:39.690 --> 05:41.650
bonding our relationship,

05:41.850 --> 05:43.290
and ending all conflicts.

05:43.810 --> 05:46.010
If we can truly cease the war,

05:46.050 --> 05:47.290
nothing could be better.

05:47.490 --> 05:49.770
After our alliance is sealed

05:50.409 --> 05:51.810
and establish trade markets,

05:52.210 --> 05:53.770
I'm sure we can

05:54.330 --> 05:56.090
get peace and benefits.

06:03.810 --> 06:05.410
Regarding the trade markets,

06:09.210 --> 06:10.250
details to be confirmed.

06:11.010 --> 06:12.570
Please be more patient.

06:18.490 --> 06:19.530
It seems Wei

06:20.050 --> 06:21.610
lacks sincerity in facilitating

06:21.770 --> 06:22.930
the alliance.

06:29.850 --> 06:30.450
What?

06:31.170 --> 06:33.130
We must let Wutuo gain all advantages

06:33.370 --> 06:34.770
to prove our sincerity?

06:44.650 --> 06:45.570
Marquis Wu'an.

06:45.810 --> 06:46.530
You are

06:46.610 --> 06:48.170
being too arrogant.

06:49.010 --> 06:51.250
Whether the trade markets open

06:51.850 --> 06:52.970
is not

06:53.570 --> 06:54.850
for you to decide.

06:57.130 --> 07:00.210
You fought Wutuo several times,

07:00.770 --> 07:01.850
yet now you speak

07:01.850 --> 07:03.010
for Wutuo.

07:03.330 --> 07:04.570
Have their blows made you

07:04.850 --> 07:06.330
a turncoat now?

07:18.290 --> 07:18.890
Your Majesty,

07:19.410 --> 07:20.890
when I led the Fuyue Army

07:20.890 --> 07:21.930
to quell rebellions,

07:22.010 --> 07:22.450
my goal

07:22.610 --> 07:24.490
was the Wei's prosperity and peace.

07:24.570 --> 07:25.890
My lifelong wish

07:25.970 --> 07:26.970
is to safeguard

07:27.010 --> 07:28.530
the Wei's land for you.

07:28.690 --> 07:29.490
Apart from that,

07:29.530 --> 07:30.410
there's nothing more.

07:31.170 --> 07:33.010
Your Majesty, please trust

07:33.130 --> 07:34.650
my loyalty.

07:40.770 --> 07:42.690
General Feihong is a loyal,

07:42.810 --> 07:43.970
peerless warrior unmatched

07:44.290 --> 07:45.250
by a thousand.

07:45.730 --> 07:46.530
He would never

07:46.570 --> 07:47.690
commit acts of treason.

07:48.650 --> 07:49.770
But the question remains:

07:50.930 --> 07:52.810
Are you General Feihong?

08:03.810 --> 08:05.490
Nonsense.

08:15.610 --> 08:16.330
Your Majesty,

08:16.330 --> 08:16.810
I have

08:17.170 --> 08:19.210
to accuse He Rufei
of three major crimes.

08:32.530 --> 08:33.650
Three major crimes?

08:34.250 --> 08:35.250
What do you mean?

08:41.289 --> 08:42.250
First crime:

08:42.929 --> 08:44.049
Substitution fraud

08:44.490 --> 08:46.130
by stealing General Feihong's identity.

08:46.730 --> 08:47.850
- What?
- What?

08:48.570 --> 08:49.530
Is this true?

08:50.090 --> 08:52.090
Please summon a witness.

08:52.850 --> 08:54.010
This person can verify

08:54.130 --> 08:55.330
the truth of my claim.

08:56.410 --> 08:56.850
Summon!

08:57.490 --> 08:59.330
By the imperial decree,

08:59.770 --> 09:00.890
summon him!

09:16.930 --> 09:18.130
Commander of Rundu Li Kuang.

09:18.530 --> 09:19.570
Greetings, Your Majesty.

09:20.130 --> 09:21.650
So you're the Commander of Rundu

09:21.650 --> 09:22.290
Li Kuang.

09:22.570 --> 09:23.490
In the Rundu battle,

09:23.650 --> 09:24.930
you deserve recognition.

09:25.170 --> 09:25.930
Please rise.

09:26.250 --> 09:27.290
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

09:35.650 --> 09:36.210
(Commander,)

09:37.210 --> 09:37.970
it's been days.

09:39.250 --> 09:39.930
You are...

09:41.570 --> 09:42.210
He Yan?

09:42.650 --> 09:43.610
I'm He Yan

09:43.890 --> 09:44.610
who fought

09:44.650 --> 09:46.130
with you at Rundu.

09:49.050 --> 09:49.970
I am Li Kuang.

09:50.610 --> 09:51.770
Greetings, General Feihong.

10:05.370 --> 10:06.050
Commander Li.

10:06.330 --> 10:07.050
You'd read

10:07.290 --> 10:08.690
this letter after we leave.

10:14.450 --> 10:16.130
Jujube and turtle...

10:16.610 --> 10:17.330
Come back soon.

10:18.170 --> 10:19.410
We Eight Warriors

10:19.530 --> 10:20.610
were born into poverty.

10:21.610 --> 10:22.930
Most were illiterate,

10:24.730 --> 10:25.610
so we devised

10:26.090 --> 10:26.890
such a crude method

10:26.930 --> 10:27.850
for communication.

10:28.690 --> 10:29.450
These codes are

10:29.610 --> 10:30.570
known only to us eight

10:30.770 --> 10:32.090
and General Feihong.

10:33.610 --> 10:34.970
Now seven were gone,

10:35.850 --> 10:36.650
leaving only

10:36.850 --> 10:37.650
me and

10:39.090 --> 10:40.810
General Feihong.

10:44.650 --> 10:45.530
Rise.

10:46.330 --> 10:47.170
I

10:48.010 --> 10:48.930
am late.

10:50.570 --> 10:51.970
Sorry, General.

10:53.130 --> 10:53.970
Rise.

11:00.250 --> 11:01.290
You're not late,

11:02.170 --> 11:03.330
but arrive in time.

11:11.210 --> 11:11.970
I

11:12.930 --> 11:13.890
dare not claim merit.

11:14.650 --> 11:16.050
If not for General Fengyun

11:16.130 --> 11:17.770
and General Feihong's

11:17.810 --> 11:18.690
timely aid,

11:19.170 --> 11:20.130
Rundu's people

11:20.890 --> 11:22.370
would've been killed

11:22.490 --> 11:24.050
by Wutuo.

11:28.170 --> 11:29.970
Li, explain yourself.

11:30.810 --> 11:31.970
The ones who saved Rundu

11:32.010 --> 11:32.970
were General Fengyun

11:33.010 --> 11:34.010
and Marquis Wu'an.

11:34.690 --> 11:36.170
Why mentioned General Feihong?

11:37.290 --> 11:38.570
Because

11:39.930 --> 11:41.010
Marquis Wu'an

11:42.050 --> 11:44.170
is the genuine General Feihong!

11:56.650 --> 11:57.410
General He,

11:58.170 --> 11:59.570
what do you have to say?

12:06.610 --> 12:07.650
Your Majesty,

12:08.010 --> 12:09.770
this man conspires with He Yan

12:09.850 --> 12:10.890
in a vile scheme

12:11.050 --> 12:12.410
to frame me!

12:13.410 --> 12:14.250
That's strange.

12:14.730 --> 12:16.450
Li Kuang served as your deputy,

12:16.690 --> 12:18.170
sharing life-and-death struggles

12:18.250 --> 12:19.290
and fighting with you.

12:20.050 --> 12:21.450
Why would he frame you now?

12:25.970 --> 12:28.810
Perhaps in the Rundu Battle,

12:29.050 --> 12:30.850
my late reinforcements

12:30.970 --> 12:33.330
angered him,

12:33.650 --> 12:36.970
making him He Yan's pawn.

12:40.370 --> 12:41.010
He Rufei.

12:41.770 --> 12:42.690
Why didn't you save

12:42.730 --> 12:43.570
your former deputy?

12:55.850 --> 12:57.650
His statements
are full of inconsistencies.

12:57.690 --> 12:59.370
He's deliberately slandering me.

13:00.490 --> 13:01.290
I'm innocent!

13:01.610 --> 13:02.930
Please judge fairly.

13:06.170 --> 13:07.130
It seems you deny

13:07.170 --> 13:08.570
the first crime charge.

13:11.730 --> 13:12.410
Marquis Wu'an.

13:12.810 --> 13:13.650
Second one.

13:17.570 --> 13:18.370
Second crime:

13:19.250 --> 13:20.570
To conceal his false identity,

13:21.210 --> 13:22.210
he eliminated

13:22.610 --> 13:23.690
his comrades!

13:24.410 --> 13:25.130
I have evidence

13:25.530 --> 13:26.730
to present.

13:29.970 --> 13:30.530
Get it to me.

13:30.730 --> 13:31.290
Yes.

13:40.500 --> 13:43.000
(To Xiao Jue)

13:50.940 --> 13:54.810
(Assassination, in Chonghuai)

13:58.290 --> 14:00.050
The assassins outside Chonghuai.

14:00.730 --> 14:01.570
General He,

14:02.130 --> 14:03.450
have you forgotten them?

14:04.610 --> 14:05.170
My lord,

14:05.890 --> 14:06.690
we discovered

14:06.690 --> 14:07.650
tattooed markings on

14:07.770 --> 14:08.570
one assassin's body.

14:08.970 --> 14:10.170
He might be a former prisoner.

14:12.650 --> 14:14.410
By tracing these markings,

14:14.690 --> 14:15.730
we can determine

14:15.730 --> 14:17.050
when and where he was imprisoned,

14:17.410 --> 14:18.090
thus,

14:19.410 --> 14:21.210
we can know his real name

14:22.330 --> 14:23.690
and background.

14:25.490 --> 14:26.610
Yang Mingzhi has replied.

14:27.610 --> 14:29.050
He found the assassins' origins.

14:29.810 --> 14:31.170
They're linked to He Rufei.

14:31.850 --> 14:32.450
So,

14:32.930 --> 14:34.490
that tattooed assassin was

14:35.010 --> 14:37.050
a distant relative
of He Mansion's steward.

14:38.570 --> 14:39.730
They did everything

14:40.410 --> 14:42.290
to eliminate me.

14:43.330 --> 14:43.970
You thought

14:44.730 --> 14:45.930
that dead men

14:46.250 --> 14:47.770
could tell nothing.

14:48.690 --> 14:50.050
But traces can't be erased.

14:50.730 --> 14:52.210
Dead men still tell us something.

14:57.130 --> 14:58.290
I don't know

14:58.690 --> 14:59.730
what you're talking about.

15:02.970 --> 15:04.130
Your steward

15:04.170 --> 15:05.650
acted so recklessly,

15:06.410 --> 15:08.090
yet you know nothing?

15:10.250 --> 15:11.490
I failed to supervise him.

15:11.650 --> 15:13.130
Your Majesty, forgive me.

15:15.370 --> 15:17.410
Besides repeated attempts to kill me,

15:17.890 --> 15:18.890
in the Huayuan Battle,

15:19.930 --> 15:21.610
the Fuyue Army's Seven Tiger Generals

15:22.330 --> 15:23.890
were ambushed and killed together.

15:24.450 --> 15:25.850
It's another scheme

15:26.370 --> 15:27.610
by He Rufei!

15:28.610 --> 15:30.370
Things change in the battlefields.

15:30.730 --> 15:31.890
We have

15:32.210 --> 15:34.210
to be flexible.

15:36.290 --> 15:36.970
He Rufei.

15:37.810 --> 15:39.130
I don't care who you are.

15:39.730 --> 15:40.410
But you fought in

15:40.410 --> 15:41.250
the Huayuan Battle.

15:42.170 --> 15:43.050
Just tell me,

15:43.770 --> 15:45.170
did you truly abandon

15:45.410 --> 15:46.490
thousands of soldiers

15:46.570 --> 15:47.690
for personal gain?

15:54.250 --> 15:55.850
Punish He Rufei severely, Your Majesty!

15:56.650 --> 15:57.650
Avenge the unjustly slain

15:58.090 --> 15:59.930
from the Huayuan Battle!

16:04.370 --> 16:07.450
Punish He Rufei severely, Your Majesty!

16:07.850 --> 16:09.370
Avenge the unjustly slain

16:09.450 --> 16:12.050
from the Huayuan Battle!

16:19.970 --> 16:20.970
Third crime:

16:21.930 --> 16:23.290
Colluding with Wutuo,

16:24.090 --> 16:25.490
and treason against Wei!

16:39.610 --> 16:41.450
False accusations!

16:42.330 --> 16:42.970
He Yan.

16:43.930 --> 16:45.690
You have no evidence

16:45.730 --> 16:47.210
at all.

16:56.130 --> 16:57.170
I do!

17:14.290 --> 17:15.930
- It's her!
- Indeed.

17:20.569 --> 17:21.849
(Why is she here?)

17:39.650 --> 17:40.770
Your Majesty,

17:41.330 --> 17:42.210
these letters

17:42.610 --> 17:44.530
are secretly hidden by He Rufei.

17:45.050 --> 17:46.250
And I stole them.

17:50.090 --> 17:51.090
They contain

17:52.130 --> 17:53.330
evidence

17:54.010 --> 17:55.890
of He Rufei's treason.

18:01.010 --> 18:01.610
Get them to me.

18:07.450 --> 18:08.530
A Madam He seeks audience

18:08.730 --> 18:09.530
outside the hall.

18:09.810 --> 18:10.610
Madam He?

18:11.090 --> 18:11.650
Who's that?

18:14.890 --> 18:15.490
Bring her in.

18:16.130 --> 18:16.650
Yes.

18:25.650 --> 18:26.810
I heard the Tianxing Platform

18:26.850 --> 18:28.170
is about to hold a night banquet.

18:29.570 --> 18:30.930
These letters

18:30.970 --> 18:31.810
should prove helpful.

18:33.290 --> 18:33.770
Thank you.

18:34.730 --> 18:35.570
General Fengyun.

18:37.210 --> 18:38.610
I have a favor to ask.

18:38.970 --> 18:40.490
Please help me enter the palace,

18:40.930 --> 18:42.810
so I can present these letters myself.

18:43.530 --> 18:44.170
No way.

18:45.210 --> 18:46.130
It'd be dangerous.

18:47.010 --> 18:47.650
Madam He.

18:48.090 --> 18:49.250
Don't get involved in it.

18:57.330 --> 18:58.450
Madam He, you don't need to.

18:58.970 --> 18:59.610
General.

19:00.210 --> 19:01.810
I'm doing this for Yan.

19:02.290 --> 19:03.890
I know Rufei resents her.

19:04.410 --> 19:05.810
I watched them

19:05.850 --> 19:06.930
harmed her once,

19:07.010 --> 19:08.330
and I must stop them now.

19:09.890 --> 19:11.290
Please help me, General.

19:13.170 --> 19:13.730
Alright.

19:14.370 --> 19:15.330
I'll help you.

19:16.610 --> 19:17.610
Regarding the evidence,

19:18.650 --> 19:20.450
please inform Yan

19:20.610 --> 19:21.450
to reassure her.

19:23.050 --> 19:24.850
But don't tell her that I'd present

19:26.370 --> 19:27.810
the evidence myself.

19:37.730 --> 19:38.250
Your Majesty.

19:38.690 --> 19:39.890
I can testify

19:41.130 --> 19:42.530
that my stepson He Rufei

19:43.610 --> 19:45.530
is not General Feihong at all.

19:46.490 --> 19:47.930
I'm the descendant of a scholar,

19:48.130 --> 19:49.850
living at home with my young daughter.

19:50.170 --> 19:52.370
He Yuansheng coveted
my family's reputation.

19:52.530 --> 19:53.930
Since my family had declined,

19:53.970 --> 19:55.290
he forced me into the He Mansion.

19:56.170 --> 19:57.450
Unexpectedly, soon after,

19:58.050 --> 19:59.610
He Rufei fell gravely ill.

20:00.290 --> 20:02.530
Physicians predicted he'd die early.

20:02.690 --> 20:04.290
He Yuansheng feared losing his title,

20:04.290 --> 20:06.250
yet couldn't bear to abandon his son.

20:06.570 --> 20:08.050
He thought adopting a boy

20:08.690 --> 20:10.090
might let him breed evil ambition,

20:10.210 --> 20:11.170
and be hard to control.

20:12.210 --> 20:14.090
So he made my daughter
disguised as a man

20:14.490 --> 20:16.330
and swap identities with He Rufei.

20:16.650 --> 20:17.970
My daughter has been clever

20:17.970 --> 20:18.980
and favors martial arts.

20:19.290 --> 20:20.450
She joined the army early

20:20.450 --> 20:21.970
and risked her life in battlefields,

20:22.610 --> 20:24.570
earning the title General Feihong.

20:24.850 --> 20:25.690
When she returned,

20:25.850 --> 20:27.530
Rufei had recovered fully.

20:28.690 --> 20:30.810
When Your Majesty awarded,

20:31.050 --> 20:32.690
He Rufei was so greedy,

20:33.410 --> 20:34.570
and He Yuansheng feared

20:34.570 --> 20:35.970
He Yan would expose them,

20:35.970 --> 20:36.450
so...

20:38.130 --> 20:38.450
they...

20:39.850 --> 20:41.490
So they poisoned

20:42.250 --> 20:43.970
and blinded her.

20:44.530 --> 20:45.050
Later,

20:45.770 --> 20:47.290
they silenced her.

20:47.890 --> 20:48.970
Your Majesty.

20:49.170 --> 20:50.210
My daughter He Yan

20:50.730 --> 20:52.810
is the genuine General Feihong!

20:53.210 --> 20:54.210
- This...
- What!

21:09.730 --> 21:10.370
What's wrong?

21:11.290 --> 21:12.570
Don't trust her!

21:12.770 --> 21:13.490
Your Majesty.

21:13.490 --> 21:14.850
This woman is too sick

21:14.850 --> 21:16.210
to think clearly.

21:16.370 --> 21:17.170
What she said

21:17.210 --> 21:18.290
is completely nonsense.

21:18.370 --> 21:19.130
I...

21:19.690 --> 21:20.930
I was telling all the truth.

21:21.290 --> 21:22.530
Your Majesty, please trust me.

21:23.930 --> 21:25.130
I told no lies.

21:25.250 --> 21:26.130
If I did,

21:27.330 --> 21:28.570
may lightning strike me,

21:29.010 --> 21:30.450
and I'd die horribly,

21:30.970 --> 21:33.050
descend to the netherworld,

21:33.090 --> 21:34.610
and never to escape.

21:34.970 --> 21:36.290
Your Majesty, please trust me.

21:37.330 --> 21:39.170
Hold justice for my daughter.

21:40.650 --> 21:41.890
Your Majesty,

21:41.970 --> 21:42.980
please summon physicians!

21:43.330 --> 21:44.010
Go summon them!

21:44.130 --> 21:44.730
Yes.

21:45.210 --> 21:46.290
Imperial physician!

21:46.330 --> 21:47.530
Your Majesty, please trust me.

21:48.730 --> 21:52.130
I was telling all the truth.

21:53.090 --> 21:54.810
I'll stake my life

21:56.650 --> 21:57.810
to prove it.

21:59.730 --> 22:00.610
Why?

22:00.850 --> 22:02.410
As a mother,

22:02.410 --> 22:04.410
I tried to protect everything.

22:04.810 --> 22:06.090
Yet in the end,

22:07.370 --> 22:09.090
I failed to protect anything.

22:09.730 --> 22:10.770
A shameless person

22:12.490 --> 22:14.370
like me

22:14.650 --> 22:16.370
doesn't deserve to live longer.

22:20.770 --> 22:21.450
Rufei,

22:37.530 --> 22:38.690
repent your sins.

22:39.730 --> 22:40.450
Rufei.

22:40.690 --> 22:41.410
Rufei.

22:41.970 --> 22:43.210
Repent your sins.

23:02.450 --> 23:03.330
Ingrate!

23:05.250 --> 23:06.090
Madam.

23:06.650 --> 23:07.810
You're sick.

23:08.930 --> 23:11.090
Really sick!

23:22.370 --> 23:23.370
Your Majesty,

23:23.530 --> 23:24.650
the poison has spread,

23:25.010 --> 23:26.210
and she is beyond cure.

23:35.930 --> 23:36.930
Don't cry.

23:38.250 --> 23:40.530
I'm not worth your tears.

23:42.650 --> 23:43.610
Mother.

23:46.530 --> 23:47.010
I...

23:47.810 --> 23:49.410
I finally heard

23:50.050 --> 23:52.170
you call me Mother.

23:53.850 --> 23:54.890
Wonderful.

23:59.930 --> 24:04.330
Cloaked in lotus splendor,

24:05.730 --> 24:08.690
yet adrift without anchor.

24:09.930 --> 24:10.770
Yan.

24:13.410 --> 24:14.170
Live...

24:26.610 --> 24:27.650
Live

24:28.650 --> 24:29.770
well.

24:47.610 --> 24:48.530
Mother!

24:53.730 --> 24:54.770
Monster!

24:59.450 --> 25:00.370
Mother.

25:05.210 --> 25:06.890
Take Madam He away first.

25:07.410 --> 25:09.050
Let her rest in peace.

25:28.890 --> 25:29.650
Mother.

25:31.090 --> 25:31.690
He Yan.

25:55.690 --> 25:56.530
He Rufei.

25:57.410 --> 25:59.010
Though we're nominally siblings,

25:59.890 --> 26:01.770
we're destined to fight.

26:09.930 --> 26:10.850
He Rufei!

26:12.570 --> 26:14.090
You deceived me,

26:14.850 --> 26:16.490
falsely claimed official titles,

26:18.250 --> 26:20.170
attempted to silence witnesses,

26:20.850 --> 26:22.290
slaughtered your comrades,

26:22.410 --> 26:23.530
and betrayed the Wei!

26:24.090 --> 26:25.290
How heinous!

26:25.410 --> 26:26.370
Unforgivable!

26:27.410 --> 26:28.890
Now we have witnesses and evidence!

26:29.170 --> 26:30.530
How dare you still deny it?

26:40.010 --> 26:42.570
This matter isn't concluded yet.

26:43.690 --> 26:46.730
Your Majesty shouldn't
convict General He

26:47.050 --> 26:48.490
hastily.

26:49.970 --> 26:51.210
Marquis Wu'an.

26:51.650 --> 26:54.090
How dare you draw sword
before the Emperor?

26:54.450 --> 26:56.290
This is great disrespect!

26:57.170 --> 26:57.810
What?

27:03.090 --> 27:05.170
Chancellor Xu, did you forget

27:05.450 --> 27:07.450
that those letters

27:07.850 --> 27:09.050
also implicate you?

27:18.930 --> 27:20.850
Your Majesty.

27:21.930 --> 27:23.530
He Rufei committed countless crimes,

27:23.890 --> 27:24.450
but he's been

27:24.450 --> 27:25.970
manipulated by Xu Jingfu.

27:26.690 --> 27:28.090
Xu Jingfu is the true

27:28.130 --> 27:29.050
mastermind

27:29.570 --> 27:30.930
who's making trouble

27:31.490 --> 27:33.530
and betraying the Wei!

27:37.650 --> 27:39.090
- Nonsense!
- Nonsense!

27:39.650 --> 27:40.410
Exactly.

27:41.170 --> 27:41.890
Back in Mingshui,

27:43.130 --> 27:44.610
you killed 30,000 Xiao Army soldiers

27:45.370 --> 27:47.130
to eliminate political rivals.

27:47.890 --> 27:48.610
Back in Yezhou,

27:49.570 --> 27:50.410
you used someone

27:50.410 --> 27:51.850
to kill Sun Xiangfu

27:52.210 --> 27:53.730
to hide your embezzlement.

27:54.170 --> 27:54.810
Back in Jiyang,

27:55.170 --> 27:56.810
you colluded with Wutuo,

27:57.050 --> 27:58.530
leading us to nearly lose Jiyang.

27:59.690 --> 28:01.490
In Huayuan and Rundu,

28:02.770 --> 28:04.290
you let He Rufei slaughter

28:04.570 --> 28:05.850
the seven generals,

28:06.130 --> 28:07.490
causing Rundu's siege.

28:07.810 --> 28:09.580
And you secretly
negotiated peace with Wutuo.

28:10.170 --> 28:11.450
Everything you've done

28:12.090 --> 28:14.090
serves only your personal gain.

28:19.490 --> 28:20.970
He corrupts the court,

28:21.450 --> 28:22.530
threatens the peace,

28:22.970 --> 28:24.210
and damages the people!

28:25.330 --> 28:27.610
His guilt is heinous!

28:34.250 --> 28:34.930
He Yan.

28:36.130 --> 28:37.730
You said Chancellor Xu was behind this.

28:37.890 --> 28:38.690
Where's your proof?

28:53.170 --> 28:54.570
He Yan speaks the truth.

28:55.210 --> 28:56.250
I am the witness!

29:10.290 --> 29:10.930
I have

29:11.290 --> 29:12.890
long been Chancellor Xu's disciple,

29:13.210 --> 29:15.010
and always respected him.

29:15.410 --> 29:16.210
But over time,

29:16.690 --> 29:18.210
I realized he

29:20.170 --> 29:21.250
wasn't a virtuous minister

29:21.250 --> 29:22.250
I believed.

29:28.890 --> 29:30.610
But he has shown me great kindness.

29:31.450 --> 29:32.650
I struggled for a long time,

29:33.450 --> 29:35.610
yet I couldn't watch him
keep making mistakes.

29:36.810 --> 29:37.610
So yesterday,

29:38.250 --> 29:39.610
I caught the Wutuo spy

29:39.650 --> 29:41.530
who's disguised
as Ganming Pavilion's owner.

29:42.330 --> 29:43.610
After the interrogation,

29:44.370 --> 29:45.170
he gave me

29:45.730 --> 29:46.450
a letter

29:47.170 --> 29:48.410
from Chancellor Xu

29:48.450 --> 29:49.770
to Wutuo envoy, Maningbu.

29:56.810 --> 29:57.850
He promises Maningbu

29:58.570 --> 30:00.850
to promote
the trade market establishment.

30:06.130 --> 30:06.690
Get it to me.

30:07.010 --> 30:07.570
Yes.

30:20.770 --> 30:22.830
(To Maningbu)

30:29.570 --> 30:36.660
(Trade Market Cooperation, Xu Jingfu)

30:52.370 --> 30:53.010
Now,

30:53.650 --> 30:54.770
I've taken that Wutuo spy

30:55.010 --> 30:56.250
outside the hall.

30:58.850 --> 31:00.490
He can confront against

31:00.850 --> 31:01.690
Envoy Maningbu.

31:03.530 --> 31:04.050
Bring him.

31:04.210 --> 31:05.490
No need.

31:07.290 --> 31:08.690
You dare defy the imperial decree?

31:14.170 --> 31:16.770
You have aged.

31:17.330 --> 31:17.970
- He...
- What...

31:18.130 --> 31:19.090
What does he want?

31:19.650 --> 31:21.330
You're deceived by traitors,

31:22.810 --> 31:24.930
believing slanders,

31:25.490 --> 31:26.730
wronging loyal ministers!

31:29.490 --> 31:33.490
This grieves me deeply.

31:36.810 --> 31:37.450
As

31:39.170 --> 31:41.490
the Chancellor of Wei,

31:41.650 --> 31:43.330
I bear the duty to purge the villains

31:43.530 --> 31:45.810
and eliminate treacherous officials!

31:47.770 --> 31:48.410
Guards!

31:49.130 --> 31:50.890
Fuyue Army, heed my command!

31:51.010 --> 31:51.970
Purge the villains!

32:09.250 --> 32:11.410
- He's committing treason!
- He's committing treason!

32:20.010 --> 32:20.970
Xu Jingfu!

32:21.570 --> 32:23.130
How dare you commit treason!

32:32.930 --> 32:33.730
Your Majesty,

32:34.290 --> 32:35.370
I've done

32:35.810 --> 32:38.050
all those things.

32:38.570 --> 32:40.730
You trust villains and alienated

32:40.770 --> 32:42.170
worthy ministers like me,

32:42.410 --> 32:44.570
failing to be a wise emperor.

32:45.210 --> 32:48.650
Naturally, I must step forward

32:48.850 --> 32:51.090
to uphold justice!

32:53.370 --> 32:54.730
You treacherous rebel!

32:55.970 --> 32:58.090
How dare you say such words

32:59.170 --> 33:01.370
and plot to usurp the throne!

33:02.130 --> 33:02.930
Your Majesty,

33:03.290 --> 33:05.450
don't get me wrong.

33:06.690 --> 33:09.690
I've been loyal to the nation.

33:09.810 --> 33:10.730
Once you

33:11.130 --> 33:12.850
issue a penitential edict

33:13.050 --> 33:14.170
and abdicates,

33:14.370 --> 33:15.050
I shall

33:15.370 --> 33:17.970
enthrone the young prince,

33:18.410 --> 33:20.130
purge the court,

33:20.410 --> 33:22.010
and restore the governance!

33:29.450 --> 33:31.770
Fuyue Army, heed my command!

33:32.530 --> 33:33.890
Purge the villains!

33:42.410 --> 33:44.450
Fuyue Army, heed my command!

33:45.130 --> 33:46.370
Purge the villains!

33:54.970 --> 33:56.810
Fuyue Army, heed my command!

33:57.410 --> 33:58.650
Purge the villains!

34:07.210 --> 34:07.650
You...

34:07.690 --> 34:08.290
His Majesty has

34:08.290 --> 34:10.050
asked the Nine Banners Battalion
to stand by

34:10.449 --> 34:11.370
to subdue the rebels!

34:11.850 --> 34:13.449
Nine Banners Battalion, heed my command!

34:13.969 --> 34:14.969
Capture the traitors!

34:15.250 --> 34:15.850
Yes!

34:15.929 --> 34:16.489
Yes!

34:27.810 --> 34:29.210
Nine Banners Battalion?

34:29.650 --> 34:30.850
Why are they here?

34:31.330 --> 34:32.090
Useless!

34:36.290 --> 34:37.090
The rebels

34:37.810 --> 34:39.530
have been suppressed.

34:43.889 --> 34:44.690
He Rufei.

34:45.409 --> 34:46.489
Most Fuyue Army soldiers

34:47.250 --> 34:48.210
fought alongside me

34:48.210 --> 34:49.730
through life and death.

34:50.489 --> 34:51.290
He Rufei.

34:52.449 --> 34:53.330
How could they

34:53.409 --> 34:55.130
obey an impostor like you?

35:09.730 --> 35:11.650
Great!

35:12.690 --> 35:14.050
So Your Majesty

35:14.450 --> 35:17.410
collaborated with Commander Xiao

35:17.490 --> 35:18.970
in this deception!

35:22.690 --> 35:24.410
Well played!

35:25.050 --> 35:26.730
You have schemed thoroughly,

35:27.010 --> 35:29.210
but overlooked your own arrogance.

35:36.090 --> 35:36.650
Master,

35:37.290 --> 35:38.650
you often taught me

35:39.210 --> 35:40.290
to serve the emperor

35:41.290 --> 35:42.210
and help the people.

35:43.130 --> 35:44.610
Yet what you've done

35:45.250 --> 35:46.290
threatens

35:46.330 --> 35:47.530
the nation

35:47.530 --> 35:48.890
and damages the people.

35:55.010 --> 35:56.250
I beg you,

35:58.290 --> 36:00.010
please stop.

36:05.570 --> 36:06.450
Zilan,

36:07.210 --> 36:09.370
I've treated you well.

36:09.930 --> 36:11.650
How dare you join forces with them

36:11.650 --> 36:13.170
to conspire against me!

36:13.610 --> 36:14.650
What benefits

36:14.650 --> 36:17.050
did they promise you

36:17.690 --> 36:18.890
to make you

36:19.170 --> 36:20.370
act so ungratefully

36:20.450 --> 36:21.810
regardless my kindness to you?

36:27.530 --> 36:29.290
You ingrate!

36:35.210 --> 36:36.650
You preach benevolence,

36:37.930 --> 36:38.690
but in my view,

36:39.450 --> 36:41.410
you're just exploiting favors for gain.

36:43.050 --> 36:44.810
National interests
outweigh personal favors.

36:45.810 --> 36:47.090
As the Chancellor,

36:47.450 --> 36:48.490
don't you know

36:48.530 --> 36:49.410
such a basic idea?

36:50.570 --> 36:51.370
Master,

36:54.370 --> 36:55.210
just surrender.

37:01.250 --> 37:02.530
Am I wrong?

37:06.090 --> 37:07.930
Everything I've done

37:08.210 --> 37:09.770
was for the Wei's

37:09.770 --> 37:11.570
future!

37:13.010 --> 37:14.610
You military officials

37:14.850 --> 37:16.890
only resort to wars.

37:17.810 --> 37:19.570
Aren't the soldiers who die in battle

37:19.650 --> 37:22.010
the Wei's citizens?

37:23.650 --> 37:26.170
Aren't the vast military funds

37:26.290 --> 37:27.370
spent year after year

37:27.370 --> 37:29.730
the hard-earned money of Wei's people?

37:34.850 --> 37:36.690
You military officials

37:36.810 --> 37:38.170
chase military glory,

37:38.170 --> 37:39.690
while ignoring the people's suffering!

37:40.170 --> 37:42.930
You're the true criminals of Wei!

37:43.250 --> 37:43.850
Nonsense!

37:44.570 --> 37:46.410
You were the one who started the war!

37:47.610 --> 37:49.690
Our army surged
with unstoppable momentum

37:50.090 --> 37:51.290
and crushed the Wutuo forces.

37:51.970 --> 37:53.170
If we won

37:53.930 --> 37:55.530
the Mingshui Battle,

37:56.130 --> 37:57.730
the war would be concluded

37:58.530 --> 38:00.010
and peace would come.

38:01.690 --> 38:03.410
But you're blinded by personal ambition.

38:04.130 --> 38:05.250
To eliminate dissidents,

38:05.530 --> 38:06.810
you conspired with enemies,

38:07.570 --> 38:08.970
sacrificing thousands

38:09.090 --> 38:10.490
of Xiao Army soldiers!

38:12.250 --> 38:13.530
Yet you didn't repent.

38:15.250 --> 38:16.690
To cover your crimes,

38:17.770 --> 38:19.970
you aided Wutuo, our enemy,

38:21.850 --> 38:23.050
and exposed the Wei's people

38:23.130 --> 38:24.690
to endless warfare!

38:25.450 --> 38:26.410
Xu Jingfu.

38:26.690 --> 38:27.770
You said what you've done

38:27.810 --> 38:29.450
was for the Wei's future,

38:30.690 --> 38:31.930
yet what you've done

38:32.010 --> 38:33.570
serves only your personal gains.

38:40.090 --> 38:40.850
Xiao Jue.

38:41.490 --> 38:43.210
Don't you understand?

38:43.650 --> 38:46.050
Military officials secure,
while civil officials govern.

38:46.370 --> 38:47.850
What strategies

38:47.970 --> 38:48.970
do you military officials

38:49.130 --> 38:51.330
have, except for warfare?

38:51.690 --> 38:53.410
Everything I've done

38:53.410 --> 38:55.170
was for the Wei!

39:00.650 --> 39:01.330
Your Majesty,

39:02.010 --> 39:04.450
my loyalty is

39:05.210 --> 39:07.850
beyond question!

39:13.850 --> 39:14.850
If everyone had

39:14.930 --> 39:16.330
such loyalty as yours,

39:16.570 --> 39:17.810
then the nation

39:19.130 --> 39:20.370
would be doomed.

39:23.610 --> 39:24.210
Yan He.

39:24.650 --> 39:25.250
Li Kuang.

39:26.250 --> 39:26.730
Yes!

39:27.810 --> 39:29.890
Take Xu Jingfu and He Rufei

39:30.050 --> 39:31.050
into custody.

39:31.570 --> 39:33.050
After the joint trial,

39:33.530 --> 39:34.450
execute them.

39:35.090 --> 39:35.770
Yes!

39:42.090 --> 39:43.930
I'll walk myself.

40:19.570 --> 40:20.370
Mr. Xiao.

40:20.730 --> 40:21.650
How should we

40:22.330 --> 40:23.810
deal with

40:24.090 --> 40:25.130
this Envoy Maningbu?

40:30.130 --> 40:30.690
Your Majesty,

40:31.290 --> 40:33.130
since Maningbu represents Wutuo

40:33.530 --> 40:34.490
as the envoy,

40:34.890 --> 40:35.810
we should

40:36.250 --> 40:37.810
detain him at the embassy,

40:38.690 --> 40:40.010
and write to the King of Wutuo,

40:40.530 --> 40:41.490
stating his crimes.

40:41.930 --> 40:43.090
His disposition rests solely

40:43.690 --> 40:45.330
on the King of Wutuo's response.

40:48.010 --> 40:48.690
Move!

40:55.090 --> 40:55.930
Marquis Wu'an.

40:57.210 --> 40:59.210
Technically, you're from the He family.

40:59.930 --> 41:00.570
The He family

41:01.170 --> 41:02.090
disguised a daughter,

41:02.170 --> 41:03.170
deceiving the Emperor.

41:03.810 --> 41:04.730
You are also at fault.

41:06.370 --> 41:08.530
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

41:08.640 --> 41:12.560
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

41:12.730 --> 41:14.680
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

41:14.770 --> 41:19.700
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

41:31.790 --> 41:33.200
♪I've seen the mountains♪

41:33.400 --> 41:34.820
♪And trodden through ice♪

41:35.080 --> 41:37.900
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

41:38.210 --> 41:39.600
♪Destiny is my creed♪

41:39.660 --> 41:41.060
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

41:41.200 --> 41:43.000
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

41:44.200 --> 41:45.670
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

41:45.840 --> 41:47.130
♪Gazing through the mire♪

41:47.300 --> 41:49.700
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

41:49.890 --> 41:51.940
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

41:53.080 --> 41:54.910
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

41:56.870 --> 41:59.790
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

41:59.880 --> 42:02.540
♪There must always be a longing♪

42:02.990 --> 42:08.060
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

42:08.390 --> 42:10.400
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

42:10.710 --> 42:14.360
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

42:14.590 --> 42:16.490
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

42:16.520 --> 42:20.360
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

42:20.720 --> 42:22.660
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

42:22.840 --> 42:26.660
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

42:26.920 --> 42:32.670
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

42:33.560 --> 42:39.030
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

42:46.180 --> 42:49.100
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

42:49.190 --> 42:51.850
♪There must always be a longing♪

42:52.310 --> 42:57.370
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

42:57.700 --> 42:59.710
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

43:00.030 --> 43:03.670
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

43:03.910 --> 43:05.800
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

43:05.830 --> 43:09.680
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

43:10.030 --> 43:11.970
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

43:12.150 --> 43:15.980
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

43:16.230 --> 43:21.990
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

43:22.870 --> 43:28.340
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪
